{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2021-11-05 09:22:00', 'title': 'MOSAIC ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SECONDARY OFFERING AND CONCURRENT SHARE REPURCHASE', 'text': 'TAMPA, FL / ACCESSWIRE / NOVEMBER 5, 2021 / THE MOSAIC COMPANY (NYSE:MOS) ("MOSAIC") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED UNDERWRITTEN SECONDARY OFFERING BY VALE S.A. AND ITS AFFILIATE (TOGETHER, THE "SELLING STOCKHOLDER") OF 34,176,574 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF MOSAIC PURSUANT TO A REGISTRATION STATEMENT FILED BY MOSAIC WITH THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION (THE "SEC").'}